  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a kadhai over medium-high heat.",
    "Add the sliced sausage and cook until browned, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the chopped onion and cook until softened, about 3 minutes.",
    "Add the minced garlic and sliced ginger and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the cumin, coriander, turmeric, and paprika, and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the mulukhiyah and cook until wilted, about 3 minutes.",
    "Reduce heat to low and simmer for 10 minutes.",
    "Remove from heat and let cool to room temperature.",
    "Chill in an ice bath to shock the vegetables.",
    "Serve warm, garnished with fresh herbs.",
    "Reheat before serving, if desired."
